{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>By the number of their names</b> — written here, but in Pinchas not written with that same counting 'by the number of their names.' Rather, it is written here to inform that they did not change their names in Egypt, and therefore it is written 'to their ancestral houses' — to tell you that they were called by the names of their fathers."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:01.041578386Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}